OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do ram-raid attacks happen in
OL,4,Aclusters?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spate of ram-raids in villages and
OL,7,Ftowns has left business owners and
OL,8,Fresidents to pick up the pieces of the
OL,9,F"wanton destruction" they leave behind.
OL,11,FWithin a single week, criminals
OL,12,Ftargeted three businesses in
OL,13,FCambridgeshire and destroyed the front
OL,14,Fof a village shop in Bedfordshire.
OL,16,F"The cash is one element, but the fear,
OL,17,Fthe damage left within the community is
OL,18,Fsomething that can't be repaired
OL,19,Fovernight," said Det Ch Insp Christian
OL,20,FO'Brien, from Cambridgeshire Police.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
